Research algorithm research method
title end

paragraph start
Platforms do not publish exact ranking weights. The sources used are industry blogs and statements by platform staff as reported by others, so every claim is marked with its source and treated as an estimate.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Method: search for each platform separately, prefer pages that cite an official statement, record the date of each page, and note where sources disagree. Compare with the analytics of the own posts, which outrank any blog.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Recheck every quarter, because ranking systems change often. Every change goes in the change log with its date.
paragraph end

